+// The in-game layout editor's panel ("Adjust Gamepad Layout", DmGamepad.m): above the chosen group's row the two-way choice Both sides together | Each
+// side on its own, the chosen group's size, all controls' size, where the layout is saved (in the shell: all games or this game), Reset to default,
+// Cancel and Done. A small dark card over the game that the player can drag by its title. It only shows values and reports what the player asks for;
+// the gamepad decides what fits (DmPadEditing.h) and shows the result back, so a slider that asks for more than fits stops where the group meets
+// another. A touch on the card is the card's: none reaches the gamepad under it. Main thread only.
+#pragma once
+#import <UIKit/UIKit.h>
